flowchart TB
    START((开始)) --> DRAFT[草稿]
    DRAFT -->|编辑 新建草稿版本| DRAFT
    DRAFT --> GEN[媒体产物生成]
    GEN --> SEC[安全审核]
    SEC --> PRODUCT[已上线]
    PRODUCT -->|删除/下架| DELETED[已删除]
    DELETED -->|还原| DRAFT
    PRODUCT -.->|旧客户端降级| FALLBACK[降级版本<br/>版本区间不允许有空隙]
    style START fill:#263238,stroke:#4c8dff,color:#ededf0
    style DRAFT fill:#263238,stroke:#4c8dff,color:#ededf0
    style GEN fill:#263238,stroke:#4c8dff,color:#ededf0
    style SEC fill:#263238,stroke:#4c8dff,color:#ededf0
    style PRODUCT fill:#1b3a2f,stroke:#00e599,color:#ededf0
    style DELETED fill:#3a1b1b,stroke:#ef5350,color:#ededf0
    style FALLBACK fill:#33281a,stroke:#ffb020,color:#ededf0
